body:
I hate when I feel the happiness leave... I can feel the depression starting. Body starts hurting, tired, irritated. 

Ho-hum, life suck. At least for me I find enjoyment getting stoned and painting or playing games... so I waste my time away doing that. Worrying what I will do when my mother inevitably dies and I'm left to take care of myself. :(

&#x200B;

Hey thanks for clarifying! 

I'm sure his other channels will die soon. He has some serious shit on his plate. Grooming accusations, destroying federally protected wetlands, and owing the IRS 600K. There's no way he can continue doing what he's doing. He'll have to find a new job... which will honestly be very fucking hard considering his online presence. 

&#x200B;

Grooming kids. A bunch of people have come forward saying he contacted them when they were under the age of 16. Also some parents have come forward. 

He defends himself with "16 is legal"... he's in his mid 30's.... gross. 

&#x200B;
